  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]\n[C]\n[F]\n[C]\n[Dm]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm]The sun is\nsleeping [C]quietly\n[Dm]Once upon\na [C]century\n[F]Wistful oc-\neans calm [C]and red\n[F]Ardent care-\nsses laid [C]to rest\n[Dm]For my\ndreams I [C]hold my\n[Dm]life For wishes\nI behold [C]my\n[Bb]night The truth\nat the end of time\n[Gm]Losing\nfaith makes a\n[Dm]crime\nI\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm]wish for this\nnighttime To\n[Bb]last for a\n[F]lifetime The\n[Gm]darkness a-\n[Dm]round me Shores\n[Bb]of a so lar\n[F]sea\n[Dm]Oh how I\nwish to go\n[Bb]down with the\n[C]sun\n[F]Sleeping,\n[C]weeping\n[Dm]with you\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm]Sorrow has\na [C]human heart\n[Dm]From my\ngod it [C]will depart\n[F]I'd sail before\na [C]thousand mo-\n[F]ons Never find\ning [C]where to go\n[Dm]Two hundred twen\ntytwo [C]days of light\n[Dm]Will be de-\nsired by [C]a\n[Bb]night A moment\nfor the poet's play\n[Gm]Until there's\nnothing left to\n[Dm]say\nI\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm]wish for this\nnighttime To\n[Bb]last for a\n[F]lifetime The\n[Gm]darkness a-\n[Dm]round me Shores\n[Bb]of a so lar\n[F]sea\n[Dm]Oh how I\nwish to go\n[Bb]down with the\n[C]sun\n[F]Sleeping,\n[C]weeping\n[Dm]with you\n\n[Bridge]\n[C]\n[Bb]\n[Dm]\n[F]\n[C]\n\n[Guitar Solo]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]\n[F]\n[Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]I\n\n[Outro]\n[Fm]wish for this\nnighttime To\n[Db]last for a\n[Ab]lifetime The\n[Bbm]darkness a-\n[Fm]round me Shores\n[Db]of a so lar\n[Fm]sea\n[Fm]Oh how I\nwish to go\n[Db]down with the\n[Eb]sun\n[Ab]Sleeping,\n[Eb]weeping\n[Fm]with you",
